    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="40.1">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:VIAtr">VI Atr</ref> 40.1</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Forþam þurh þæt hit sceal on earde godian to ahte, þe man unriht alecge ⁊ rihtwisnesse lufige for Gode ⁊ for worlde.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">For it is only by the suppression of injustice and the love of righteousness in matters both religious and secular that any improvement shall be obtained in the condition of the country.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Forðam þurh þæt hit sceal on earde godian to ahte, þæt man unriht alecge ⁊ rihtwisnesse lufige for Gode ⁊ for worlde.</ab>
      </div>
